From 96bf5efcf6e0928bc4b59bff80b7eca2186c66be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carter Chen <carter.chen.wiwynn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Dec 2025 08:46:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fw_update: Reimplement package parser to use new libpldm API

libpldm has revised the APIs for firmware package, the old APIs are
now deprecated. Switch to the new APIs and use libpldm iterators to
ensure compatibility with the latest libpldm version.

- Build Yosemite V4: Pass
- Firmware update Yosemite V4 PLDM components: Pass

[1] https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/80194/122

Change-Id: I56106c66b61167bae8398c8616c376941097c627
Signed-off-by: Unive Tien <unive.tien.wiwynn@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Carter Chen <carter.chen.wiwynn@gmail.com>
